description	"Mandalorian Neo-Crusader Warrior

Standard Neo-Crusader Warriors entrusted with lesser weaponry and equipment as they have lesser skills and abilities compared to their peers.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- Mandalorian Vibrosword
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
-- Single Saber
-- Yellow/Red Style (Or Duals)
-- Combo Limit (3)
-- Saber Defense (0)
- Mandalorian Heavy Blaster Pistol (1)
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed

^8Attributes:
- Assemble (3)
- Physical Resist
- 15% less Kb Taken
- Tracking Beacon
- Environment Protection (1)
- Blast Armor
- Beskar (1)
- 25% slower Skill CD

^8Abilities:
- Grapple Hook ^3[CS3]"